  "contrib": "W3siaWQiOiJGaWxlIiwiaXNVc2VyRXh0ZW5zaW9uIjpmYWxzZSwibmFtZSI6IkZpbGUiLCJyZWYiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tL3RpYmNvL2Zsb2dvLWZpbGVzL3NyYy9hcHAvRmlsZSIsInMzbG9jYXRpb24iOiJUaWJjby9GaWxlIiwidGFnIjoiMy4wLjAtYjAxLXYzLW1haW4iLCJ2ZXJzaW9uIjoiMy4wLjAifV0=",
  "data": {
    "description": "Step 2: Reads session state, merges financial profile, writes back. Idempotent.",
    "fe_metadata": "eyJTdGFydEFjdGl2aXR5Ijp7IngiOjUwLCJ5Ijo1MH0sIlJlYWRBcHBsaWNhdGlvblN0YXRlIjp7IngiOjIwNywieSI6NTd9LCJXcml0ZUZpbmFuY2lhbFByb2ZpbGUiOnsieCI6NDAzLCJ5Ijo1NX0sIlJldHVybiI6eyJ4Ijo2MDEsInkiOjUxfX0=",
    "links": [
      {
